{
  "name": "Daily Grants.gov opportunity digest with Apify",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "days",
              "triggerAtHour": 8,
              "triggerAtMinute": 0
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "id": "11111111-1111-4111-8111-111111111111",
      "name": "Every morning at eight",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [
        -760,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "search-keyword",
              "name": "keyword",
              "value": "infrastructure",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "search-max-items",
              "name": "maxItems",
              "value": 25,
              "type": "number"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "22222222-2222-4222-8222-222222222222",
      "name": "Set grant search criteria",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        -520,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "apifyApi",
        "resource": "Actors",
        "operation": "Run actor and get dataset",
        "actorSource": "store",
        "actorId": "evpp~grants-gov",
        "customBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ keyword: $json.keyword, oppStatuses: [\"posted\"], includeDetails: true, maxItems: $json.maxItems, proxyConfiguration: { useApifyProxy: false } }) }}",
        "timeout": 300,
        "memory": 512,
        "build": ""
      },
      "id": "33333333-3333-4333-8333-333333333333",
      "name": "Find matching federal grants",
      "type": "@apify/n8n-nodes-apify.apify",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "logic": "removeItemsWithAlreadySeenKeyValues",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.opportunityNumber || $json.opportunityId }}",
        "options": {
          "scope": "node",
          "historySize": 20000
        }
      },
      "id": "44444444-4444-4444-8444-444444444444",
      "name": "Only new opportunities",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "grant-title",
              "name": "title",
              "value": "={{ $json.title }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-agency",
              "name": "agency",
              "value": "={{ $json.agency }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-number",
              "name": "opportunityNumber",
              "value": "={{ $json.opportunityNumber }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-close-date",
              "name": "closeDate",
              "value": "={{ $json.closeDate }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-award-ceiling",
              "name": "awardCeiling",
              "value": "={{ $json.awardCeiling }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-total-funding",
              "name": "estimatedTotalFunding",
              "value": "={{ $json.estimatedTotalFunding }}",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "id": "grant-url",
              "name": "url",
              "value": "={{ $json.url }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "55555555-5555-4555-8555-555555555555",
      "name": "Keep decision fields",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        240,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "select": "channel",
        "channelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "grants-watch",
          "mode": "name"
        },
        "text": "={{ \"New Grants.gov opportunity: \" + $json.title + \" | \" + ($json.agency || \"Unknown agency\") + \" | closes \" + ($json.closeDate || \"date not listed\") + \" | \" + $json.url }}",
        "otherOptions": {}
      },
      "id": "66666666-6666-4666-8666-666666666666",
      "name": "Tell the grants channel",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.slack",
      "typeVersion": 2.3,
      "position": [
        500,
        0
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## What this does\n\nEvery morning it searches Grants.gov for newly posted federal funding opportunities, removes opportunities already sent by this workflow, and posts the remaining matches to Slack.\n\nThis gives grant writers, nonprofits, researchers, and small businesses a short daily digest instead of another inbox full of repeated search results.\n\n## Setup\n\n1. Install the Apify node. It is verified by n8n, so it works on Cloud and on self-hosted instances.\n2. Add your Apify API token in the Apify node credentials.\n3. Edit the \"Set grant search criteria\" node. Change the keyword, or empty it to monitor all newly posted opportunities.\n4. Point the Slack node at your channel, or replace it with email, Google Sheets, Notion, or a webhook.\n5. Activate the workflow.\n\nThe workflow uses the public `evpp/grants-gov` Actor. The default input is capped at 25 detailed opportunities per run. The Actor is pay-per-event, so keep the cap aligned with your budget.\n\n## Customizing the search\n\nThe Actor supports agency codes, funding categories, applicant eligibilities, and forecasted or closed statuses. See the input reference and sample output at https://intius.github.io/evp-labs-data-extractors/actors/grants-gov/\n\nOnly monitor public opportunities you are eligible to pursue. Review each notice on Grants.gov before making an application decision."
      },
      "id": "77777777-7777-4777-8777-777777777777",
      "name": "Read me",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -760,
        260
      ]
    }
  ],
  "pinData": {},
  "connections": {
    "Every morning at eight": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Set grant search criteria",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Set grant search criteria": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Find matching federal grants",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Find matching federal grants": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Only new opportunities",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Only new opportunities": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Keep decision fields",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    },
    "Keep decision fields": {
      "main": [
        [
          {
            "node": "Tell the grants channel",
            "type": "main",
            "index": 0
          }
        ]
      ]
    }
  },
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
